   "fieldtype": "Percent",
   "label": "Score %",
   "read_only": 1,
   "description": "For charts only. <b>Reads 0 when there is no score at all</b>, so it is meaningless unless Measurability says otherwise -- which is exactly why Score above is the field people read."
